test.yaml:77:15: Claude Code Action runs in a workspace that holds the code of a pull request (checked out in the step at line 71), and this workflow runs on "issue_comment", with the secrets of the base repository. the agent reads its instructions and configuration from the workspace (files such as CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, GEMINI.md, .claude/settings.json, .mcp.json and .gemini/settings.json), so the pull request can add instructions, hooks and tool servers. check out the base branch in the workspace and put the pull request in a subdirectory with "path:" [agentic-actions]
